;ReviewCompiler[0]: `return run execute as <multi> run function f` where f does not `return`:
; vanilla's FallthroughTask after the first source's call fails the frame and discards the other calls.
@setup
objective create t dummy

@function run
scoreboard players set #calls t 0
scoreboard players set #after t 0
summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["mcfc_rf"]}
summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["mcfc_rf"]}
summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["mcfc_rf"]}
scoreboard players set success t 7
execute store success score success t run function mcfc-test:outer
scoreboard players set result t 7
execute store result score result t run function mcfc-test:outer
kill @e[tag=mcfc_rf]

@function outer
return run execute as @e[tag=mcfc_rf] run function mcfc-test:count
scoreboard players set #after t 1

@function count
scoreboard players add #calls t 1

@validate
score #calls t is 2
score #after t is 0
score success t is 0
score result t is 0
